</mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> directly from <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-schur-complement\">@def-schur-complement</span>, and\ncheck <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-elimination-is-schur-complements\">@thm-elimination-is-schur-complements</span>\nin both cases.</p>","file":"ch24-applied/02-elimination-pivoting-and-cost.html"}